			"notes": "# This Bedrock is unbreakable! - Version 1.3\n## Changes: Rebalance of Blue Slime Spawn\n- Blue Slimes only spawn in Slime Chunks now\n- Add random Chance for Slimes to spawn, the higher the terrain the higher the chance\n- Blue Slimes can spawn in a group of one to three Mobs now\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Translation for Blue Slime added\n- 1.21.1 NeoForge compostable chance of sliced onions aligned with other versions\n- 1.19.2 Forge onion spawn biomes aligned with other versions\n\n## Supported minecraft versions\n- 1.21.1 NeoForge\n- 1.20.1 Forge\n- 1.19.2 Forge\n\n## Change Credits\n**Developers:** LeunoSam, snydto"
