			"notes": "# This Bedrock is unbreakable! - Version 1.2\n## Changes\n- Add Weeping Potion => Mobs drop Tears if killed with Weeping Effect active\n- Obsidian Steel Pickaxe Right Click Action only destroys Bedrock now (no more accidental voiding of other blocks)\n- Onion Grass is now lootable with shears \n- Rebalanced  damage taken by ObsidianKnife when cutting onions\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Adjusted Blue Slime Spawn: added missing snowy plains\n- Fixed Onion Grass Spawn in 1.19.2\n- Fixed in-transparent BlueSlimeBlock in 1.20.1\n\n## Supported minecraft versions\n- 1.21.1 NeoForge\n- 1.20.1 Forge\n- 1.19.2 Forge\n\n## Change Credits\n**Developers:** LeunoSam, snydto\n**PM:** JoLuKei"
